  "details": "Details to reproduce the bug:\n\nStep 1. Join a friend in VRChat.\n\nStep 2. Leave their instance.\n\nThey will now show up as being in a private instance until you restart your game client.\n\nIt's especially noticeable with a large group of friends in an instance.\n\nYou spend some time in that friend's group instance, hop to another one, and then all those people in the first instance are inexplicably labeled as being in a private world.\n\nThis has been a bug for at least a few months now, confirmed with multiple friends that have also been having it so it's not just me.",
